examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt: "auth.jwt" is refused by --target haproxy: HAProxy's jwt_verify takes one key file, with no key set, URL, issuer or audience check; verify the token in the service auth.ask names
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.audiences: "auth.jwt.audiences" is refused by --target haproxy: HAProxy's jwt_verify takes one key file, with no key set, URL, issuer or audience check; verify the token in the service auth.ask names
